          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ijambo ry’Uhoraho rinzako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, vuga ubūre, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo ni mvuge, nt’ Inkota, inkota, irakarihijwe kand’ irartyorowe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yakarihijwe kugira ngw iririke; yartyorowe kugira ngw ibe nk’umuravyo: none twoja aho, tukitwengera? Inkoni y’umwana wanje igaya izindi zakūwe mu giti cose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nkota yatanzwe ngw irtyororwe ngw ibone gukoreshwa: iyo nkota yakarihijwe, mbere yartyorowe, kugira ngw ishirwe mu kuboko kw’ūririka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turikisha uboroge, mwana w’umuntu, kukw ibanguriwe abantu banje, ibanguriwe abaganwa bose b’Abisirayeli: bagerewe inkota hamwe n’abantu banje: shirako wishishitire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw amateka aciwe: kandi namb’ iyo nkoni yagayana itakiriho, vyomera bite? ni k’Umwami Uhoraho abaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.24.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 24:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
