              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 25:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.13+AMO.1.14+AMO.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 1:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utoborere inzira iyo nkota ngw ije ahitwa i Raba h’ubgoko bg’Abamoni, n’iyindi ngw ije i Buyuda i Yerusalemu hazitijwe inzitiro z’ amabuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.31.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 31:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umwami w’i Babuloni ahagaze mu mayirabiri, ah’ izo nzira zompi zishamikiye, kugira ngw araguze: azungagiza imyampi, akaraguza ibigirwamana vyitwa terafimu, agasuzuma igitigu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo ni ho haranze i Yerusalemu, ngw ahomvoze inzitiro zaho ibiti vy’imigogo, yasamire abazoharirikirwa, ashire hejuru avuze akarūru, ahomvoze amarembo ibiti vy’ imigogo, akirundire ibigunguzi vyo kwūririrako, yubake n’ibihome vyo kuhatera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.20"
