          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, mwana w’umuntu, vuga ubūre, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize ku vy’ubgoko bg’ Abamoni, no ku vy’igitutsi cabgo; maz’ uvuge, ut’ Inkota, inkota irasokowe, yartyororewe kuririka, kugira ngw imaririkanye, ibe nk’ umuravyo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bākuroteye inzozi z’ubusa, n’indagu z’ibinyoma, ngo ni wewe uzoyibangurira ku mazosi y’abanyakibi bākomerekejwe akagīrīre, abo umusi wabo washitseko, mu gihe giherahereza ibigabitanyo vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisubize mu rwubati rwayo. Ahantu waremewe, mu gihugu wavukiyemwo, aho ni ho nzogucirira urubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 22:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.22.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzokurekurirak’ ubushangashirwe bganje, nkwakirizek’ umuriro w’ uburake bganje, nkugabure mu maboko y’abantu bameze nk’ibikōko, bazi guhonnya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 25:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzoba inkwi z’umuriro; n’amaraso yawe azodēngēra hagati mu gihugu; kandi ntuzosubira kwibukwa ukundi: kuko jewe Uhoraho mbivuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
